OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Kinahan's lawyers to apply
OL,4,Afor bail in due course, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn application for bail is to be made
OL,7,Fon the behalf of Daniel Kinahan in due
OL,8,Fcourse, the Special Criminal Court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FThe application will be made through
OL,12,Fthe High Court in Dublin.
OL,14,FDarragh Mackin of Phoenix Law, who is
OL,15,FKinahan's solicitor, appeared in court
OL,16,Fon Monday where he confirmed an
OL,17,Fapplication will be made for bail.
OL,19,FKinahan is charged with directing the
OL,20,Factivities of a criminal organisation
OL,21,Fbetween 18 October 2015 and 6 April
OL,22,F2017.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
